sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant A as Backend API
  participant S as S3
  B->>A: POST /uploads (filename, type, size)
  Note over A: Authenticate, validate, build key
  A-->>B: Presigned PUT URL (expires in minutes)
  B->>S: PUT object directly to URL
  S-->>B: 200 OK
  S-)A: ObjectCreated event (SQS or EventBridge)
  A->>A: Mark upload complete, process file
